{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-input-traffic#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-input-traffic","commit":"78404c744ea319420758fbe1c540af2692834598","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-input-traffic 是面向 DSH Web 的输入队列管理插件，通过替换会话输入区的等待队列栏和增加冻结按钮控制消息处理时机。它把忙碌期间发送的消息放入队列，支持稍后处理、当前动作结束后插入或中断当前执行后立即处理，并可编辑、删除、排序和批量清空消息。用户还可按会话冻结执行、调整冻结队列并在恢复时按设定顺序重新提交。适合需要安排繁忙会话输入或暂停单个会话的 DSH Web 用户；无需额外 API 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:182-242","src/client/steer-queue-dock.tsx:113-117","src/client/freeze-button.tsx:50-101"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-input-traffic#card-en","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-input-traffic","commit":"78404c744ea319420758fbe1c540af2692834598","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-input-traffic manages busy DSH web input. It replaces the queue dock with options to defer, insert after the current action, or interrupt for immediate handling. Users can edit and reorder messages, then freeze a session and resume its planned queue. No extra API configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:182-242","src/client/steer-queue-dock.tsx:113-117","src/client/freeze-button.tsx:50-101"]}
